<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">28082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Ratko Mladić has died in detention at The Hague, aged eighty-four, serving a life sentence for the genocide at Srebrenica.</s> <s>Judges proved intent not from speeches but from logistics — the buses, the blindfolds, the mass graves at a place the United Nations had declared a safe area.</s> <s>That evidentiary standard is cited in every genocide case since, including the proceedings on Gaza... while Republika Srpska's leadership still denies the killings happened at all.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia struck nine Ukrainian cities overnight, killing a seventy-eight-year-old woman in Zaporizhzhia as explosions carried over Kyiv into the morning.</s> <s>The tactic is saturation — cheap jet-powered drones aren't launched to hit air defences, they're launched to make them fire, so a battery spending a four-million-dollar interceptor on a fifty-thousand-dollar airframe loses even when it wins.</s> <s>Ukrainian intelligence says longer-range Iskander variants now sit beyond the reach of counter-battery hunts.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>That magazine is近 empty across the alliance.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Six months of war on Iran burned roughly sixty-five percent of American Patriot interceptors, and what remains is being rationed among Ukraine, Israel, the Gulf states and Taiwan.</s> <s>The Center for Strategic and International Studies counts one thousand five hundred of two thousand three hundred and thirty spent — and interceptors take years to build, against strikes that come nightly.</s> <s>Whoever decides the allocation is deciding which cities are defended.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In southern Lebanon, Israeli soldiers turned back an aid convoy bound for the last three Christian villages standing inside the occupied border zone.</s> <s>Residents wait hours for permission to cross what the occupying force calls the yellow line, and every rebuilding of a wall requires a permit — the buffer zone as an administrative object, thinning a population not by expulsion but by making return uneconomic.</s> <s>Israel and Lebanon are about to hold another round of talks, without them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombia has designated several armed groups as terrorist organisations, and a single word in the decree closes a door.</s> <s>Terrorist status bars fighters from the surrender and demobilization deals available to ordinary criminal suspects, while opening the way to foreign military assistance and to lethal force framed as war rather than policing.</s> <s>Colombia's courts have overturned less than this before.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gunmen in Quetta killed an Afghan man this week, the third such killing in Balochistan in a fortnight.</s> <s>Pakistan's repatriation drive stripped registration from hundreds of thousands of Afghans, including former Afghan army officers, so the undocumented can't report a threat without risking deportation themselves.</s> <s>Untraceable by law means untraceable when they disappear.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Dhaka, a tribunal built in nineteen seventy-three to try mass atrocity is now being used against journalists.</s> <s>Its statute allows relaxed evidence rules, restricted appeals and no constitutional challenge — a design meant for genocide cases, offering a reporter almost no defence.</s> <s>Some of the accused deny the charges entirely; none can test the law that holds them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A federal judge in San Francisco has voided the Pentagon's designation of the AI company Anthropic as a supply-chain risk, calling the ban illegal and baseless.</s> <s>Such a listing is an administrative act, not a charge — no hearing, no evidence standard, no forum to contest it — and it removes a company from federal procurement and from the vendor lists of everyone who sells to Washington.</s> <s>The ruling turns on process, not on whether the security concern was ever real, and an appeal is likely.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In South Africa, the architect Minenhle Makhanya has been ordered to repay one hundred and forty-seven million rand for the upgrades to Jacob Zuma's Nkandla homestead.</s> <s>The judge said he clearly didn't act alone, yet he stands alone as defendant — a civil tribunal can order repayment on a balance of probabilities, which is exactly why it got a result where prosecutions didn't.</s> <s>The officials who signed the requisitions haven't been named.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Thirty-year United States Treasury yields have reached five point three percent, a level last seen in two thousand and seven.</s> <s>Yields price expected inflation plus risk, and tariffs, a closed Strait of Hormuz and heavier defence spending have loaded all three into American debt — on forty trillion dollars, one tenth of a percentage point costs forty billion a year.</s> <s>South and Southeast Asia take that shock twice... once as imported energy, once as a currency.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran's Mohsen Rezaei says traffic through the Strait of Hormuz will resume only through negotiation, and named an end to the wars in Gaza and Lebanon as the first condition.</s> <s>A strait closes through insurance, not warships — war-risk premiums and reinsurance withdrawal are what actually stop hulls, which is why a negotiation is literally the instrument of reopening.</s> <s>Tehran is drafting formal terms; the statement reached us through a Russian state wire, and no Iranian outlet has yet confirmed it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bahrain's economy contracted three point eight percent — the first hard evidence that the war is costing Gulf economies output, not just revenue.</s> <s>It holds the Gulf's smallest oil reserves, so the shipping disruption reaches its books faster than its neighbours'.</s> <s>Brent crude fell four point one percent over the same stretch, which helps no one who has nothing to sell.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Jamaat-e-Islami has called a nationwide strike in Pakistan for the third of September against the petroleum levy.</s> <s>The levy is a fixed per-litre charge sitting outside the sales-tax base and outside the provincial share, so every rupee stays federal — which is why lenders favour it, and why a tax designed to be invisible is now the most visible thing in Pakistani politics.</s> <s>Diesel is the freight and irrigation fuel, so this becomes a food price in about two months.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Brazil's Bank Master case has widened from banking fraud into something stranger: Daniel Vorcaro allegedly ran a private militia alongside the bank.</s> <s>The pattern was high-yield deposits pulled from retail savers, then moved through the bank's own loan book and interbank transfers — a licensed institution used as a laundering rail, reporting to the central bank all the while.</s> <s>Depositors and the guarantee fund now carry what supervisors missed for years.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Gilgit-Baltistan has opened its markhor hunting permits at two hundred thousand dollars each.</s> <s>Pakistan's community trophy quotas, set by annual wildlife surveys, turned an animal that competes with livestock for grazing into a village's most valuable asset, and the fees fund the conservancies protecting the herds.</s> <s>Operators warn the model breaks the moment the survey stops being honest.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>And research out of Britain finds that workers who can quit report far less discrimination.</s> <s>The effect comes from employer incentive rather than stronger law — where one employer dominates a local market, no one can credibly threaten to leave, so discrimination costs the employer nothing at all.</s> <s>Kafala rules across the Gulf tie a worker to a single sponsor, which is the same finding read from the other end.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Off Qaqortoq in Greenland, the most fertile water in the sea sits directly against solid ice.</s> <s>Meltwater surges up from a glacier's base, dragging deep nutrients to the surface and triggering blooms that anchor the fisheries which are Greenland's largest export.</s> <s>Once a glacier's edge retreats onto land, the pump stops... and the plume goes with it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hawaiʻi is getting drier and stormier at the same time, and resolving that contradiction is the whole lesson.</s> <s>A warmer atmosphere holds roughly seven percent more moisture per degree, so rain falls harder even as rainy days grow fewer — and storm drains and dam spillways are sized from historical intensity curves that have quietly expired.</s> <s>Which describes Java, the Philippines, and Karachi's nullahs just as well.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study in Nature finds that genetic risk scores for heart disease barely beat a coin toss outside European populations.</s> <s>Heritability reflects a population and its environment, and almost all gene-disease data comes from European-ancestry volunteers — yet these scores are already being sold to clinics.</s> <s>South Asians develop coronary disease earliest of any group, and are among the least well described by the very tools meant to predict it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russian-speaking criminals used a mainstream AI coding assistant, unmodified, to breach seven companies.</s> <s>They bypassed its safeguards simply by claiming the intrusion was an authorised test — and the hard parts of an attack, reconnaissance and reading unfamiliar code, are exactly what such a tool does well.</s> <s>That's not a new capability, it's a collapsed skill floor, which makes mid-sized firms worth attacking for the first time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A related study found one hundred and twenty websites publishing installation instructions that pointed at package names nobody had registered.</s> <s>Coding agents read vendor documentation as instructions, so whoever claims an unregistered name first gets code execution inside whoever follows the guide — and a few dozen companies, some in the Fortune five hundred, ran it.</s> <s>One hundred and nineteen of those sites are still misconfigured.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A civil complaint alleges that Elon Musk's company xAI trained its Grok models on child sexual abuse material.</s> <s>The claim isn't about what the model produced but what the corpus contained — and the National Center for Missing and Exploited Children maintains free hash lists that detect known material without a human ever viewing it.</s> <s>These are unproven allegations, but nothing obliges a model developer to run that check, and no regulator inspects a training set.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Poland's researchers found one thousand six hundred and fifty-five ghost-authored records on a single repository — papers whose listed authors don't exist.</s> <s>Language models invent the same plausible names repeatedly, and peer review checks method and argument, never whether a person is real.</s> <s>Fabricated findings, once cited by genuine papers, can't be un-published.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>And in Catania, a new drone system can find a drowning swimmer who occupies just a few dozen pixels of a moving frame.</s> <s>It pairs super-resolution detection with frame-to-frame tracking, so a body hidden by a swell isn't lost or counted twice — the failure mode of every existing system in the sea states that actually kill people.</s> <s>The identical model serves rescue and interception; the only difference is who's flying the aircraft.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>